Sandbox image (sandbox/Dockerfile; built locally, not redistributed by this repository)
  Arch Linux base image and the pacman/pip packages it installs (python, nodejs, tesseract, clang, git,
  neo4j driver, pip-audit, requests, pytesseract, pybind11, ...) are under their own licences. Check them
